<title>BELGIUM: Primakov-Solana open talks.</title>
<headline>Primakov-Solana open talks.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>NATO Secretary-General Javier Solana and Russian Foreign Minister Yevgeny Primakov opened a new round talks on Sunday on a treaty or charter between the two former Cold War foes.</p>
<p>The talks at Solana's residence are expected to last about four hours. NATO wants the deal with Russia to go hand in hand with its plans to expand into eastern Europe later this year, a move which Moscow strongly opposes.</p>
</text>
